+// N2 based inter NG-RAN handover (simulation).
+//
+// Source side (see sendHandoverRequired / receiveHandoverCommand):
+//   NGAP Handover Required -> AMF -> ... -> NGAP Handover Command -> RRC Reconfiguration to the UE.
+// Target side (see receiveHandoverRequest / handleHandoverConfirm):
+//   NGAP Handover Request -> resource allocation -> Handover Request Acknowledge ->
+//   (UE appears on the target cell) -> Handover Notify.
+//
+// The radio interface of UERANSIM is simulated, therefore the transparent containers exchanged
+// over NGAP are filled with the simulation-defined payloads from lib/ho. See docs for details.
